{"book":10,"chapter":48,"rubric":"LEARNING RUST / CHAT: AXUM, SQLX, TOKIO / CHAPTER 48","slides":[{"title":"Who writes","sub":"Chapter 48 · Users","short":"Intro","main":"The chat needs sign-up, login, session tokens and permissions: who can write and what they can change.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Sign-up","Token","Permissions"],"captions":["A person signs up and logs in; the server recognizes them","Every request is signed with a session token","Any logged-in user can write to rooms; only the owner changes the topic"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":70.0,"w":100.0,"h":30.0,"text":"sign-up","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":120.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":134.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":180.0,"y":70.0,"w":80.0,"h":30.0,"text":"login","tone":"blue","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":220.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":244.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":300.0,"y":70.0,"w":100.0,"h":30.0,"text":"server knows","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":80.0,"y":70.0,"w":100.0,"h":30.0,"text":"request","tone":"blue","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":220.0,"y":70.0,"w":120.0,"h":30.0,"text":"Authorization:\nBearer …","tone":"yellow","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e","x1":130.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":156.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":320.0,"y":70.0,"w":70.0,"h":30.0,"text":"server","tone":"green","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":282.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":284.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":50.0,"w":130.0,"h":26.0,"text":"write: all logged in","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":90.0,"y":100.0,"w":130.0,"h":26.0,"text":"topic: owner","tone":"yellow","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":280.0,"y":75.0,"text":"checked on the server","tone":"muted","size":9.0}]],"cues":[12.3,24.7]}]},{"title":"Hash, not cipher","sub":"Storing passwords","short":"Hashes","main":"A password is not encrypted but hashed with a slow salted function: the original cannot be recovered.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Not plain, not cipher","Slow hash","Salt"],"captions":["An encryption key leaks along with the database; a hash is irreversible","Fast hashes are brute-forced by the billions; passwords are hashed deliberately slow and memory-hungry","Random salt: same passwords, different hashes, precomputed tables are useless"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":50.0,"w":100.0,"h":24.0,"text":"plain ✗","tone":"red","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":70.0,"y":90.0,"w":100.0,"h":24.0,"text":"cipher ✗","tone":"red","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":70.0,"y":130.0,"w":100.0,"h":24.0,"text":"hash ✓","tone":"green","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n1","x":240.0,"y":90.0,"text":"key leaks\nwith the DB","tone":"muted","size":9.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":80.0,"y":50.0,"w":120.0,"h":26.0,"text":"SHA-256: 10⁹/s","tone":"red","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":80.0,"y":100.0,"w":120.0,"h":26.0,"text":"argon2: 10/s per core","tone":"green","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":270.0,"y":75.0,"text":"slows\nGPUs too","tone":"muted","size":9.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":50.0,"w":100.0,"h":24.0,"text":"123456 + salt1","tone":"blue","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":120.0,"y1":50.0,"x2":154.0,"y2":50.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":250.0,"y":50.0,"w":110.0,"h":24.0,"text":"$2e9c…","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":70.0,"y":100.0,"w":100.0,"h":24.0,"text":"123456 + salt2","tone":"blue","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":120.0,"y1":100.0,"x2":154.0,"y2":100.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"d","x":250.0,"y":100.0,"w":110.0,"h":24.0,"text":"$7a31…","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[12.4,24.7]}]},{"title":"Argon2","sub":"Hashing in Rust","short":"Argon2","main":"Argon2id: time and memory parameters live inside the PHC string; verification reads them from the hash.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["PHC string","Verify","Rehash"],"captions":["Algorithm, parameters, salt and hash in one string; one column in the DB","verify_password reads the parameters from the string and compares in constant time","Raise the parameters: old hashes still work and are rehashed at login"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["$argon2id$v=19$m=19456,t=2,p=1$","  <salt>$<hash>","-- algorithm, memory (KiB), passes, threads"],"hl":[0,1],"lang":"rust","size":9.0,"lh":28.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["let hash = Argon2::default().hash_password(pw)?;","Argon2::default().verify_password(pw, hash.as_str())","    .is_ok()"],"hl":[0,1],"lang":"rust","size":8.5,"lh":28.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":50.0,"w":130.0,"h":26.0,"text":"m=19456 (old)","tone":"yellow","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e","x1":156.0,"y1":50.0,"x2":214.0,"y2":50.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":290.0,"y":50.0,"w":130.0,"h":26.0,"text":"m=65536 at login","tone":"green","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":110.0,"text":"needs_rehash → rehash","tone":"muted","size":9.0}]],"cues":[13.2,26.5]}]},{"title":"Sign-up","sub":"Creating an account","short":"Sign-up","main":"Validate the data, hash the password, insert the row; a repeated name is a conflict.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Validate","Hash and insert","Conflict"],"captions":["Name length, password length and content: 422 with a list of problems","Password → hash → INSERT; the password reaches neither the DB nor the log","A taken name is rejected by UNIQUE (23505) → 409; no separate existence check needed"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":50.0,"w":130.0,"h":26.0,"text":"name: 3–16 chars","tone":"blue","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":90.0,"y":100.0,"w":130.0,"h":26.0,"text":"password: ≥ 8, digit","tone":"blue","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e","x1":156.0,"y1":75.0,"x2":214.0,"y2":75.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":290.0,"y":75.0,"w":120.0,"h":30.0,"text":"422 + fields","tone":"yellow","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":70.0,"w":100.0,"h":30.0,"text":"password","tone":"blue","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":120.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":134.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":180.0,"y":70.0,"w":80.0,"h":30.0,"text":"argon2","tone":"green","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":220.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":244.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":300.0,"y":70.0,"w":100.0,"h":30.0,"text":"INSERT","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":50.0,"w":130.0,"h":26.0,"text":"SELECT: name free?","tone":"red","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n1","x":270.0,"y":50.0,"text":"race between\ncheck and insert","tone":"red","size":9.0},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":90.0,"y":105.0,"w":130.0,"h":26.0,"text":"INSERT → 23505 → 409","tone":"green","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n2","x":270.0,"y":105.0,"text":"atomic","tone":"green","size":9.0}]],"cues":[12.3,24.7]}]},{"title":"Login","sub":"Reveal nothing extra","short":"Login","main":"Same response for an unknown name and a wrong password; a dummy check evens out the timing.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["One response","Timing","Attempt limit"],"captions":["Unknown name and wrong password get the same response with the same text","For an unknown name a dummy hash check runs too","Attempts per name and address are limited: brute force is impractical"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":50.0,"w":130.0,"h":26.0,"text":"no such name","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":90.0,"y":100.0,"w":130.0,"h":26.0,"text":"wrong password","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":156.0,"y1":50.0,"x2":214.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":156.0,"y1":100.0,"x2":214.0,"y2":80.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":290.0,"y":75.0,"w":120.0,"h":36.0,"text":"401\n\"wrong name\nor password\"","tone":"green","size":8.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":50.0,"w":110.0,"h":24.0,"text":"no name: 1 ms","tone":"red","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":70.0,"y":100.0,"w":110.0,"h":24.0,"text":"password: 60 ms","tone":"red","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":260.0,"y":75.0,"text":"the gap\nleaks names","tone":"red","size":9.0},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":270.0,"y":125.0,"w":130.0,"h":22.0,"text":"dummy verify → 60 ms","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":70.0,"w":100.0,"h":30.0,"text":"5 attempts","tone":"yellow","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e","x1":120.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":154.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":250.0,"y":70.0,"w":130.0,"h":30.0,"text":"429 + Retry-After","tone":"red","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[12.5,25.0]}]},{"title":"Session tokens","sub":"Randomness and hash","short":"Tokens","main":"A token is 256 random bits; the DB stores its hash so a leaked table gives no access.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["256 bits","Hash in the DB","Once"],"captions":["32 random bytes from the system generator, in hex or base64","The sessions table stores the SHA-256 of the token; a leaked table gives no access","The client gets the token once; on each request we hash the presented one and look it up"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["let t: [u8; 32] = rand::random();","let token = hex::encode(t);   // 64 chars","// 2^256 options: brute force is impossible"],"hl":[0,1],"lang":"rust","size":9.0,"lh":28.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":50.0,"w":130.0,"h":26.0,"text":"token: ab12…ff","tone":"yellow","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e","x1":156.0,"y1":50.0,"x2":214.0,"y2":50.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":290.0,"y":50.0,"w":130.0,"h":26.0,"text":"sha256 → to the DB","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":110.0,"text":"table holds only the hash","tone":"muted","size":9.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":50.0,"w":100.0,"h":24.0,"text":"login → token","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":120.0,"y1":50.0,"x2":154.0,"y2":50.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":250.0,"y":50.0,"w":120.0,"h":24.0,"text":"client keeps it","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c~cell","x":70.0,"y":100.0,"w":100.0,"h":24.0,"text":"request + token","tone":"blue","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":120.0,"y1":100.0,"x2":154.0,"y2":100.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"d","x":250.0,"y":100.0,"w":120.0,"h":24.0,"text":"sha256 → lookup","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[12.4,24.7]}]},{"title":"Bearer header","sub":"Presenting the token","short":"Bearer","main":"The token travels in Authorization: Bearer …; parsing ignores scheme case but is strict about form.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Format","Strict parsing","Not in the URL"],"captions":["Authorization: Bearer <token> — the scheme is case-insensitive","No header, other scheme, empty token, extra parts: rejected","URLs end up in logs and history; the exception is the WebSocket (special solution)"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["Authorization: Bearer 3f9a1c…e0","authorization: bearer 3f9a1c…e0   // also valid"],"hl":[0,1],"lang":"rust","size":9.5,"lh":30.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":40.0,"w":140.0,"h":22.0,"text":"Bearer abc ✓","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":90.0,"y":70.0,"w":140.0,"h":22.0,"text":"Basic abc ✗","tone":"red","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c~cell","x":90.0,"y":100.0,"w":140.0,"h":22.0,"text":"Bearer ✗","tone":"red","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"d","x":90.0,"y":130.0,"w":140.0,"h":22.0,"text":"Bearer a b ✗","tone":"red","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":60.0,"w":150.0,"h":26.0,"text":"/api/me?token=… ✗","tone":"red","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n1","x":290.0,"y":60.0,"text":"logs, history","tone":"red","size":9.0},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":90.0,"y":110.0,"w":150.0,"h":26.0,"text":"header ✓","tone":"green","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[13.0,26.1]}]},{"title":"CurrentUser","sub":"User extractor","short":"CurrentUser","main":"The CurrentUser extractor reads the token and loads the user; a handler with it is unreachable without login.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Extractor","Guard in the signature","State"],"captions":["Reads the header, hashes the token, finds a live session, returns the user","The CurrentUser argument builds protection in: without login the function is never called","The pool comes from state via FromRef; it can be swapped in tests"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":14.0,"lines":["impl<S> FromRequestParts<S> for CurrentUser","where PgPool: FromRef<S>","{","    type Rejection = AppError;     // 401","    async fn from_request_parts(..) -> Result<..> { .. }","}"],"hl":[0,3],"lang":"rust","size":8.5,"lh":17.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["async fn me(user: CurrentUser) -> Json<UserOut> {","    Json(user.into())","}","// no token: 401, function not called"],"hl":[0,3],"lang":"rust","size":9.0,"lh":26.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":70.0,"w":100.0,"h":30.0,"text":"State","tone":"blue","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":120.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":134.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":180.0,"y":70.0,"w":80.0,"h":30.0,"text":"FromRef","tone":"green","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":220.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":244.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"c~cell","x":300.0,"y":70.0,"w":100.0,"h":30.0,"text":"PgPool","tone":"green","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[12.6,25.1]}]},{"title":"Lifetime","sub":"Expiry and logout","short":"Lifetime","main":"A session has a lifetime; logout deletes it; logging in elsewhere must not pile up sessions forever.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Expiry","Logout","Session limit"],"captions":["expires_at in the row; lookup ignores expired ones","logout deletes the session — the token stops working at once; \"log out everywhere\" — all sessions","At most N active sessions per person; expired ones are cleaned by a background task"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["SELECT user_id FROM sessions","WHERE token_hash = $1","  AND expires_at > now()"],"hl":[2],"lang":"rust","size":9.5,"lh":28.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":50.0,"w":130.0,"h":26.0,"text":"DELETE ... WHERE hash","tone":"green","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n1","x":280.0,"y":50.0,"text":"this token — all","tone":"muted","size":9.0},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":90.0,"y":105.0,"w":130.0,"h":26.0,"text":"DELETE ... WHERE user","tone":"green","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n2","x":280.0,"y":105.0,"text":"log out everywhere","tone":"muted","size":9.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":70.0,"w":60.0,"h":26.0,"text":"s1","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":140.0,"y":70.0,"w":60.0,"h":26.0,"text":"s2","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c~cell","x":210.0,"y":70.0,"w":60.0,"h":26.0,"